[0.000, "o", "m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## 1. Mandatory Verification Gates\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m14 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m15 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mEvery companion app in \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`./tutorial/apps/<NNNN-slug>/`\u001b[39m must pass two automated gates with zero warnings and 100%\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mpassing tests before a lesson is complete:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m16 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m17 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m```bash caption=\"Run static analysis and headless unit/widget tests inside any lesson app directory\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 45 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
