[0.000, "o", ": Headless browser, Enzyme wrapper\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 3 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m_Avoid_: Headless browser, Enzyme wrapper\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## 3. Data Modeling, Persistence & Reactive State (Lessons 0002–0005)\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Freezed Data Class**:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mAn immutable Dart class annotated with \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`@freezed`\u001b[39m whose generated mixin (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`_$ClassName`\u001b[39m in \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`*.freezed.dart`\u001b[39m)\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39msynthesizes value equality (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`==`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`hashCode`\u001b[39m), \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`toString()`\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`copyWith(...)`\u001b[39m cloning—replacing TypeScript\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39minterfaces paired with \u001b[38;2"]
[0.001, "o", ";151;198;123m`{ ...obj }`\u001b[39m object spread.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m_Avoid_: Mutable POJO, ORM entity\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Part File (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`part`\u001b[39m / \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`part of`\u001b[39m)**:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mA Dart compilation-unit directive that splits a single library across multiple source files (such as\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`catalog_models.dart`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`catalog_models.freezed.dart`\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`catalog_models.g.dart`\u001b[39m) so generated code can access\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mprivate constructors (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`_Container`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`_Part`\u001b[39m) and implement mixins in the same namespace.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m_Avoid_: C \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`#include`\u001b[39m macro, separate module"]
[0.000, "o", " import\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m14 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 15 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this change\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.971, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\n\u001b[J\u001b[31A\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[94mdark-mode\u001b[m: I declared \u001b[94m<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\" />\u001b[m in \u001b[94m<head>\u001b[m and set \u001b[94mcolor-scheme: dark\u001b[m, \u001b[94maccent-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mcolor\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mscrollbar-color\u001b[m paired with \u001b[94mscrollbar-width: thin\u001b[m on \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m (plus \u001b[94m@supports not (scrollbar-color: auto)\u001b[m\r\n  legacy WebKit fallbacks and re-applied \u001b[94maccent-color\u001b[m on \u001b[94m<pre>\u001b[m blocks) to prevent white flashes and ensure custom\r\n  scrollbars render on macOS (\"You MUST pair custom colors with \u001b[94mscrollbar-width\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mthin\u001b[m or \u001b[94mauto\u001b[m) to force macOS\u001b[K\r\n  to render them.\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mcross-document-transitions\u001b[m: I wrapped \u001b[94m@view-transition { navigation: auto; }\u001b[m inside \u001b[94m@media (prefers-reduced-\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mmotion: no-preference)\u001b[m in \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m so multi-page navigations between the course index, lessons,\u001b[K\r\n  and reference sheets cross-fade smoothly without violating motion preferences (\"Both the source and d"]
[0.000, "o", "estination\u001b[K\r\n  pages must opt-in to view transitions for the browser to trigger them on navigation.\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mcss\u001b[m: I organized \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m into explicit \u001b[94m@layer base, theme, layout, components, utilities, \u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mprint;\u001b[m priority zones, used \u001b[94m:not(:disabled)\u001b[m on button hover states, and scoped \u001b[94mbox-sizing: border-box\u001b[m to explicit\u001b[K\r\n  element types instead of \u001b[94m*\u001b[m to prevent specificity collisions (\"\u001b[1mDO NOT\u001b[m use global resets (styles on \u001b[94m*\u001b[m) as they\u001b[K\r\n  cannot be overridden by web components or lower-priority cascade layers (without \u001b[94m!important\u001b[m).\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94maccessibility\u001b[m: I added semantic landmarks (\u001b[94m<header>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<nav aria-label=\"...\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<main id=\"main-content\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<footer>\u001b[m),\u001b[K\r\n  a \u001b[94m.skip-link\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<th scope=\"col\">\u001b[m table headers, and \u001b[94m:where(...):focus-visible\u001b[m outlines with \u001b[94moutline-offset: 2px\u001b[m to\u001b[K\r\n  keep keyboard navigation visible without mouse focus noise (\""]
[0.000, "o", "When defining custom focus indicators, always style\u001b[K\r\n  the \u001b[94m:focus-visible\u001b[m state (not \u001b[94m:focus\u001b[m) explicitly.\").\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please implement the first five lessons\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 54.7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(I'm thinking through how to approach this.)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 6 files \u001b[37m(catalog_persistence.dart, file_catalog_persistence.dart, part_search_engine.dart, +3)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 3 files \u001b[37m(course.js, build.py, GLOSSARY.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n⢿  \u001b[90mWai\u001b[94mting.\u001b[90m..\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /context to see what files are in the conversation.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
