[0.000, "o", "002 • Freezed & Domain Models\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39msubtitle: \"Replace TypeScript interfaces, object spread ({ ...part }), and JSON.parse with Dart 3 sound null\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39msafety, \u001b[38;2;181;188;197m@freezed\u001b[39m data classes, copyWith, and build_runner codegen.\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mcard:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m  title: \"**Immutable Domain Models with Freezed & JSON Serialization**\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m  summary: \"Model Container, Part, and CatalogSnapshot in lib/catalog/catalog_models.dart using \u001b[38;2;181;188;197m@freezed\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m  json_serializable, computed getters, and the 1-to-1 (Container, Slot) lookup.\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m---\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m#"]
[0.000, "o", "# Why Plain Dart Classes Aren't Like TypeScript Interfaces {\u001b[38;2;181;188;197m#why\u001b[39m-freezed}\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 14 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mIn TypeScript, modeling an immutable domain entity takes zero runtime code:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 15 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 16 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m```ts caption=\"TypeScript interface + object spread in a React codebase\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 17 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mexport interface Part {\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 18 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m  readonly id: string;\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 497 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
[41.715, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[J\u001b[31A\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[94mdark-mode\u001b[m: I declared \u001b[94m<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\" />\u001b[m in \u001b[94m<head>\u001b[m and set \u001b[94mcolor-scheme: dark\u001b[m, \u001b[94maccent-\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mcolor\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mscrollbar-color\u001b[m paired with \u001b[94mscrollbar-width: thin\u001b[m on \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m (plus \u001b[94m@supports not (scrollbar-color: auto)\u001b[m\r\n  legacy WebKit fallbacks and re-applied \u001b[94maccent-color\u001b[m on \u001b[94m<pre>\u001b[m blocks) to prevent white flashes and ensure custom\u001b[K\r\n  scrollbars render on macOS (\"You MUST pair custom colors with \u001b[94mscrollbar-width\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mthin\u001b[m or \u001b[94mauto\u001b[m) to force macOS\u001b[K\r\n  to render them.\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mcross-document-transitions\u001b[m: I wrapped \u001b[94m@view-transition { navigation: auto; }\u001b[m inside \u001b[94m@media (prefers-reduced-\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mmotion: no-preference)\u001b[m in \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m so multi-page navigations between the course index, lessons,\u001b[K\r\n  and reference sheets cross-fade smoothly without violating motion preferences (\"Both the source a"]
[0.000, "o", "nd destination\u001b[K\r\n  pages must opt-in to view transitions for the browser to trigger them on navigation.\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mcss\u001b[m: I organized \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m into explicit \u001b[94m@layer base, theme, layout, components, utilities, \u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mprint;\u001b[m priority zones, used \u001b[94m:not(:disabled)\u001b[m on button hover states, and scoped \u001b[94mbox-sizing: border-box\u001b[m to explicit\u001b[K\r\n  element types instead of \u001b[94m*\u001b[m to prevent specificity collisions (\"\u001b[1mDO NOT\u001b[m use global resets (styles on \u001b[94m*\u001b[m) as they\u001b[K\r\n  cannot be overridden by web components or lower-priority cascade layers (without \u001b[94m!important\u001b[m).\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94maccessibility\u001b[m: I added semantic landmarks (\u001b[94m<header>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<nav aria-label=\"...\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<main id=\"main-content\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<footer>\u001b[m),\u001b[K\r\n  a \u001b[94m.skip-link\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<th scope=\"col\">\u001b[m table headers, and \u001b[94m:where(...):focus-visible\u001b[m outlines with \u001b[94moutline-offset: 2px\u001b[m to\u001b[K\r\n  keep keyboard navigation visible without mouse focus nois"]
[0.000, "o", "e (\"When defining custom focus indicators, always style\u001b[K\r\n  the \u001b[94m:focus-visible\u001b[m state (not \u001b[94m:focus\u001b[m) explicitly.\").\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please implement the first five lessons\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 2m 19s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Drafting lessons 0002, 0003, and 0004 covering immutable domain models using a specific packa...)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 6 files \u001b[37m(catalog_persistence.dart, file_catalog_persistence.dart, part_search_engine.dart, +3)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 4 files \u001b[37m(course.js, build.py, GLOSSARY.md, +1)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n⡿  \u001b[90mEditin\u001b[94mg fil\u001b[90mes...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Press ctrl+g to open an external editor for long prompts.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────"]
