[0.000, "o", " and destination\u001b[K\r\n  pages must opt-in to view transitions for the browser to trigger them on navigation.\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mcss\u001b[m: I organized \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m into explicit \u001b[94m@layer base, theme, layout, components, utilities, \u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mprint;\u001b[m priority zones, used \u001b[94m:not(:disabled)\u001b[m on button hover states, and scoped \u001b[94mbox-sizing: border-box\u001b[m to explicit\u001b[K\r\n  element types instead of \u001b[94m*\u001b[m to prevent specificity collisions (\"\u001b[1mDO NOT\u001b[m use global resets (styles on \u001b[94m*\u001b[m) as they\u001b[K\r\n  cannot be overridden by web components or lower-priority cascade layers (without \u001b[94m!important\u001b[m).\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94maccessibility\u001b[m: I added semantic landmarks (\u001b[94m<header>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<nav aria-label=\"...\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<main id=\"main-content\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<footer>\u001b[m),\u001b[K\r\n  a \u001b[94m.skip-link\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<th scope=\"col\">\u001b[m table headers, and \u001b[94m:where(...):focus-visible\u001b[m outlines with \u001b[94moutline-offset: 2px\u001b[m to\u001b[K\r\n  keep keyboard navigation visible without mouse focus no"]
