[0.084, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• \u001b[94mdark-mode\u001b[m: I declared \u001b[94m<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\" />\u001b[m in \u001b[94m<head>\u001b[m and set \u001b[94mcolor-scheme: dark\u001b[m, \u001b[94maccent-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mcolor\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mscrollbar-color\u001b[m paired with \u001b[94mscrollbar-width: thin\u001b[m on \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m (plus \u001b[94m@supports not (scrollbar-color: auto)\u001b[m\r\n  legacy WebKit fallbacks and re-applied \u001b[94maccent-color\u001b[m on \u001b[94m<pre>\u001b[m blocks) to prevent white flashes and ensure custom\u001b[K\r\n  scrollbars render on macOS (\"You MUST pair custom colors with \u001b[94mscrollbar-width\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mthin\u001b[m or \u001b[94mauto\u001b[m) to force macOS\r\n  to render them.\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mcross-document-transitions\u001b[m: I wrapped \u001b[94m@view-transition { navigation: auto; }\u001b[m inside \u001b[94m@media (prefers-reduced-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mmotion: no-preference)\u001b[m in \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m so multi-page navigations between the course index, lessons,\r\n  and reference sheets cross-fade smoothly without violating motion preferences (\"Both the source and destination\u001b[K\r\n  pages"]
[0.000, "o", " must opt-in to view transitions for the browser to trigger them on navigation.\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mcss\u001b[m: I organized \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m into explicit \u001b[94m@layer base, theme, layout, components, utilities, \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mprint;\u001b[m priority zones, used \u001b[94m:not(:disabled)\u001b[m on button hover states, and scoped \u001b[94mbox-sizing: border-box\u001b[m to explicit\r\n  element types instead of \u001b[94m*\u001b[m to prevent specificity collisions (\"\u001b[1mDO NOT\u001b[m use global resets (styles on \u001b[94m*\u001b[m) as they\u001b[K\r\n  cannot be overridden by web components or lower-priority cascade layers (without \u001b[94m!important\u001b[m).\").\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94maccessibility\u001b[m: I added semantic landmarks (\u001b[94m<header>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<nav aria-label=\"...\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<main id=\"main-content\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<footer>\u001b[m),\r\n  a \u001b[94m.skip-link\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<th scope=\"col\">\u001b[m table headers, and \u001b[94m:where(...):focus-visible\u001b[m outlines with \u001b[94moutline-offset: 2px\u001b[m to\u001b[K\r\n  keep keyboard navigation visible without mouse focus noise (\"When defining custom focus indi"]
[0.000, "o", "cators, always style\r\n  the \u001b[94m:focus-visible\u001b[m state (not \u001b[94m:focus\u001b[m) explicitly.\").\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please implement the first five lessons\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThinking...\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Building upon the persistence structure, the third app will integrate reactive state management usin...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 6 files \u001b[37m(catalog_persistence.dart, file_catalog_persistence.dart, part_search_engine.dart, +3)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[33;1mdited\u001b[m 8 files \u001b[37m(course.js, build.py, GLOSSARY.md, +5)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[53D\u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(cd tutorial && .venv/bin/python build.py --check)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRunning\u001b[m \u001b[37m(cp -cR tutorial/apps/0001-flutter-bootstrap-and-provider-scope tutorial/apps/0002-imm...)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\n\u001b[17D\u001b[94mng th\u001b[90me \u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7C\u001b[90mPress ctrl+b to send a long task to the"]
