[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[26A  and reference sheets cross-fade smoothly without violating motion preferences (\"Both the source and destination\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  pages must opt-in to view transitions for the browser to trigger them on navigation.\").\r\n  • \u001b[94mcss\u001b[m: I organized \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m into explicit \u001b[94m@layer base, theme, layout, components, utilities, \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mprint;\u001b[m priority zones, used \u001b[94m:not(:disabled)\u001b[m on button hover states, and scoped \u001b[94mbox-sizing: border-box\u001b[m to explicit\r\n  element types instead of \u001b[94m*\u001b[m to prevent specificity collisions (\"\u001b[1mDO NOT\u001b[m use global resets (styles on \u001b[94m*\u001b[m) as they\r\n  cannot be overridden by web components or lower-priority cascade layers (without \u001b[94m!important\u001b[m).\").\r\n  • \u001b[94maccessibility\u001b[m: I added semantic landmarks (\u001b[94m<header>\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<nav aria-label=\"...\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<main id=\"main-content\">\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<footer>\u001b[m),\r\n  a \u001b[94m.skip-link\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<th scope=\"col\">\u001b[m table headers, and \u001b[94m:where(...):focus-visible\u001b[m outli"]
[0.000, "o", "nes with \u001b[94moutline-offset: 2px\u001b[m to\r\n  keep keyboard navigation visible without mouse focus noise (\"When defining custom focus indicators, always style\r\n  the \u001b[94m:focus-visible\u001b[m state (not \u001b[94m:focus\u001b[m) explicitly.\").\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please implement the first five lessons\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 7m 28s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial hypothesis: Running package and test commands will validate the new applications' bui...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 6 files \u001b[37m(catalog_persistence.dart, file_catalog_persistence.dart, part_search_engine.dart, +3)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 8 files \u001b[37m(course.js, build.py, GLOSSARY.md, +5)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m… 8 more actions (4 edits, 4 commands) …\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 4 files \u001b[37m(pubspec.yaml, main.dart, widget_test.dart, +1)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 2 command"]
